      "created_at": "2016-12-20T16:31:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is the difference between:</p><p>Until the start of next turn, Effect A happens.</p><p>vs.</p><p>Effect A happens. Destroy this card at the start of the turn.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In the second case, if the card is destroyed early, Effect A stops.</p>",
